<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of European Cup</p>
<p>Champions' League matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Auxerre: Auxerre (France) 2 Glasgow Rangers (Scotland) 1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Auxerre - Lilian Laslandes 20, Steve Marlet 31</p>
<p>Rangers - Richard Gough 34</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>In Zurich: Grasshopper Zurich (Switzerland) 0 Ajax Amsterdam</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 1</p>
<p>Scorer: Patrick Kluivert 31.</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,000</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Madrid: Atletico Madrid (Spain) 1 Widzew Lodz (Poland) 0</p>
<p>(0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Milinko Pantic 83</p>
<p>Attendance: 23,000</p>
<p>In Dortmund: Borussia Dortmund (Germany) 5 Steaua Bucharest</p>
<p>(Romania) 3 (halftime 3-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund - Stephane Chapuisat 13, 22, Rene</p>
<p>Tretschok 43, Karlheinz Riedle 62, Michael Zorc 64.</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest - Sabin Ilie 17 pen, Marius Baciu 52, Aurel</p>
<p>Calin 79.</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Turin: Juventus (Italy) 2 Fenerbahce (Turkey) 0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Michele Padovano 41, Nicola Amoruso 84</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,899</p>
<p>In Vienna: Rapid Vienna (Austria) 0 Manchester United</p>
<p>(England) 2 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Ryan Giggs 24, Eric Cantona 72</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Milan: AC Milan (Italy) 1 Rosenborg (Norway) 2 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Christophe Dugarry, 45</p>
<p>Rosenborg - Harald Brattbakk 29, Vegard Heggem 69</p>
<p>Attendance: 29,000</p>
<p>In Gothenburg: IFK Gothenburg (Sweden) 0 Porto (Portugal) 2</p>
<p>(0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Mario Jardel 64, Edmilson 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,448</p>
